<p>What keeps us busy in the winter? It''s a wide range of services - we''ve built storage areas, closets and loft beds. We''ve replaced lights, sinks, toilets and appliances. We have put up baby gates, assembled furniture, hung mirrors, painted, replaced trim, put up walls and weather proofed houses.Show us your to do list and we''ll let you know what we can do for you!</p>
<p>"Thank you so much Eric for doing a fantastic job on our landscaping. You went above and beyond to ensure the new sod took...saved a tree in our backyard and cleaned up and pruned our gardens. You and your crew were efficient, courteous and very personable. I look forward to seeing you in the spring. I would without hesitation recommend your company. Thanks again."</p>', 'Spruced Up Property Beautification Services — landscaping in Toronto |', 'Book Spruced Up Property Beautification Services for landscaping services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (1', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:38:53.668Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 7, 'ChIJd3G24C_N1IkR88Rhnq3JkaQ', '2026-08-06T06:38:56.392Z', '2026-08-06T06:38:56.392Z')
