  VALUES ('cmsh5ao3qucykun5rl2c3', 'GTA Landscaping Toronto', 'gta-landscaping-toronto-79dcc9', 'landscaping', '+1 647-979-9248', NULL, 'http://www.gtalandscaping.com/', '162 Davenport Rd, Toronto, ON M5R 1J2', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Toronto', 'ON', 'M5R 1J2', 43.675354899999995, -79.3945298, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.7, 102, 'GTA Landscaping Toronto — landscaping in Toronto', '<p>With over 12 years of expertise, GTA Landscaping, a highly regarded landscape contractor proudly serving Toronto, sets the benchmark in the industry as a certified professional member of Landscape Ontario. Our team of both landscape designers and professional builders, offers a diverse range of services including but not limited to driveway interlocking, creating aesthetically pleasing outdoor spaces, and backyards. Our fully insured services come with a reassuring 5-year limited warranty, ensuring peace of mind for our valued customers. Serving areas in Toronto, Vaughan, Richmond Hill, and beyond, we ensure your outdoor space is not just aesthetically pleasing but also a reflection of our unwavering commitment to enhancing your property’s curb appeal.</p>
<p>Our landscape contractors use sustainable materials for driveways and walkways, reducing environmental impact. By incorporating green solutions in design and construction, we not only enhance outdoor spaces but also promote eco-conscious practices. Our commitment to eco-friendliness reflects in every project, prioritizing both beauty and sustainability.</p>', 'GTA Landscaping Toronto — landscaping in Toronto | Fieseros', 'Book GTA Landscaping Toronto for landscaping services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.7★ (102 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:38:56.390Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJ8fe6iqY0K4gRFRW-Si2TOZg', '2026-08-06T06:38:56.392Z', '2026-08-06T06:38:56.392Z')
