<p>From clean and conservative looks to custom and engaging designs, we can do it all. Our skilled, friendly and professional craftsmen have you covered.</p>
<p>The professional Stonehaven Landscapes craftsmen have the skills and mindset to create gorgeous commercial scapes that are proud, inviting and durable.</p>
<p>Stonehaven Landscapes'' craftsmen can work with your ideas, or even bring some ideas of our own to help bring that landscaping vision into fruition.</p>', 'Stone Haven Landscapes — landscaping in Toronto | Fieseros', 'Book Stone Haven Landscapes for landscaping services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (55 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:39:03.162Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJ739yLXh4hlQRqOSnfynsOqY', '2026-08-06T06:39:04.712Z', '2026-08-06T06:39:04.712Z')
