<p>For more details on 👉 professional interlocking…</p>', 'Groupe Constructek Inc. — landscaping in Montréal | Fieseros', 'Book Groupe Constructek Inc. for landscaping services in Montréal. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (25 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:39:13.913Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJkXqf5cwbyUwRzzuF5MbRL9s', '2026-08-06T06:39:28.019Z', '2026-08-06T06:39:28.019Z')
