<p>Providing you with the most memorable experience, Aguib Creations takes charge of your project and ensures a worry free enjoyable experience from start to finish.</p>
<p>Education is the foundation of all! At Aguib Creations we ensure that our staff…</p>', 'Aguib Creations Inc — landscaping in Montreal | Fieseros', 'Book Aguib Creations Inc for landscaping services in Montreal. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (32 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:39:35.436Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJD6TCApcZyUwRom1d_--lpes', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z')
