<p>Our expert team specializes in revitalizing unistone surfaces, giving them a fresh, modern look. Whether it''s countertops, floors, or walls, we can transform any space with our sustainable approach to renovation.</p>
<p>We offer comprehensive full lawn maintenance services to keep your outdoor space looking pristine and healthy throughout the year, including mowing, fertilizing, bushes trimming, spring and fall clean up, etc.</p>
<p>Add security and beauty to the pool and your house, our fences are of the highest quality guaranteed. If you are in…</p>', 'Del Rio Inc Paysagiste Landscaping — landscaping in Montréal | Fiesero', 'Book Del Rio Inc Paysagiste Landscaping for landscaping services in Montréal. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (7 reviews', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:39:31.546Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 5, 'ChIJx6ZJWgAXyUwRW3hnotcGzks', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO "Tenant" ("id", "name", "slug", "industry", "phone", "email", "website", "address", "country", "currency", "city", "state", "postalCode", "latitude", "longitude", "serviceRadiusKm", "plan", "marketplaceOptIn", "publicProfileEnabled", "listingTier", "claimed", "rating", "reviewCount", "tagline", "description", "seoTitle", "seoDescription", "businessCategoriesJson", "settingsJson", "employeesCount", "googlePlaceId", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
