<p>From ongoing services, such as lawn mowing or snow removal, to transformative projects, ranging from excavations to French drain, fencing or deck installations and even paving, our team of professionals has the experience and expertise to meet your needs and exceed your expectations.</p>
<p>Whether you want to revamp your outdoor space or have the outdoor maintenance of your home or business handled by professionals, our full suite of services can provide everything you need to increase and maintain the visual appeal and value of your property.</p>
<p>Let us tend to your mowing to keep your lawn looking healthy and flourishing all summer long.</p>
<p>From seeding to fertilizing and more, our lawn care services provide everything you need for a lush lawn.</p>
<p>With an experienced team and modern equipment, we can make short work of your excavation needs.</p>', 'EL Paysagiste — landscaping in Montréal | Fieseros', 'Book EL Paysagiste for landscaping services in Montréal. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.5★ (14 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:39:30.880Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 10, 'ChIJ9ToQY-wRyUwRnzhesf1Oq5g', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z', '2026-08-06T06:39:35.437Z')
