  VALUES ('cmsh5cd9etbjuhounjslv', 'Urban Oasis Developments Inc', 'urban-oasis-developments-inc-eea9cd', 'landscaping', '+1 587-226-6435', NULL, 'http://www.urban-oasisdev.com/', '5319 3 St SE Unit 737, Calgary, AB T2H 1J7', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Calgary', 'AB', 'T2H 1J7', 51.006689099999996, -114.0580921, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 34, 'Urban Oasis Developments Inc — landscaping in Calgary', '<p>At Urban Oasis we turn your dreams into your own backyard oasis. We will walk you through the whole process in turning your home into the natures retreat that you have always been looking for.</p>
<p>At Urban Oasis, we can take care of your basement development, kitchen and bathroom renovations, and new home additions.</p>
<p>“I loved working with Mike and his crew. He had great ideas while thinking through the complexity and costs of each element of our yard. The end result was fantastic. We are off of a pathway and all our neighbors continually talk about how great our yard looks. I think it is pretty awesome too. Thanks Mike and Team!”</p>
<p>We offer complete hardscaping services from retaining walls, patios, stairs, walkways, outdoor fireplaces, deckes, fences, privacy walls using materials such as wood, stone, and concrete. We also offer interior renovation services including bathroom and kitchen renovations.</p>
<p>If you travel anywhere, you’ll notice that Calgary is one of the most beautiful cities in the world. Calgary’s beauty is not just from its natural features such as the mountains and Bow River but in how Calgarians take care of their homes – and landscaping is…</p>', 'Urban Oasis Developments Inc — landscaping in Calgary | Fieseros', 'Book Urban Oasis Developments Inc for landscaping services in Calgary. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (34 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:15.650Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 6, 'ChIJE2C5LB92cVMROXtz_G6T4N4', '2026-08-06T06:40:18.311Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:18.311Z')
