<p>Isle Group offers complete services including landscape design, high-quality landscape supplies and materials, outdoor lighting installation, and artificial turf solutions. Whether you''re interested in a redesign or a new installation, we handle it all.</p>
<p>Get started with a free consultation and quote to achieve your dream landscape, without any pressure or hidden costs.</p>
<p>As a locally owned and operated Edmonton landscaping company, w e couldn’t be more proud to be part…</p>', 'Isle Group Landscaping — landscaping in Edmonton | Fieseros', 'Book Isle Group Landscaping for landscaping services in Edmonton. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (85 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:28.397Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJj0OyErsfoFMRr8ULrY_VGOQ', '2026-08-06T06:40:33.979Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:33.979Z')
