  VALUES ('cmsh5csz6lxcb77txhz8a', 'Dutch Yardworks Ltd', 'dutch-yardworks-ltd-e5eba6', 'landscaping', '+1 780-233-1825', NULL, 'http://www.dutchyardworks.ca/', '10212 152 St NW, Edmonton, AB T5P 1Y2', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Edmonton', 'AB', 'T5P 1Y2', 53.5437206, -113.5836619, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 22, 'Dutch Yardworks Ltd — landscaping in Edmonton', '<p>With over 30 years of experience in the industry, our yard designs include custom designed paving stone retaining walls and other hardscape features. We also repair and refresh existing hardscapes and install fencing. Our ultimate goal is your complete satisfaction.</p>
<p>Our mission is to make the exterior of your home attractive and functional, raising the property value and beautifying your whole neighborhood. We love our craft and pay extra attention to the details, and your satisfaction is of the highest importance.</p>
<p>All of our installations come with a 5yr workmanship warranty . We are also fully insured, bonded and WCB covered. We are also a member of the BBB. Your satisfaction is our priority and we strive to provide a service we are proud of. If it''s not exactly how you like it, we will fix it.</p>
<p>I followed in my Fathers footsteps of Landscaping after growing up on a tree nursery. I attended the Landscape Gardener program at Olds College graduating in 1992. After several years of working for contractors in different aspects of the landscaping field I found my love was in Hardscaping, and more specifically paving stone retaining walls and fencing. With over…</p>', 'Dutch Yardworks Ltd — landscaping in Edmonton | Fieseros', 'Book Dutch Yardworks Ltd for landscaping services in Edmonton. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (22 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:36.018Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJVVWR-gwhoFMRBEElfpt5Kbc', '2026-08-06T06:40:39.880Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:39.880Z')
