<p>With over 45 years of experience in designing and landscaping both residential and commercial locations, we have expanded to include a landscape supply centre where…</p>', 'RCLcanada Landscape Contractors and Supply — landscaping in Edmonton |', 'Book RCLcanada Landscape Contractors and Supply for landscaping services in Edmonton. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.4★ (3', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:37.715Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 5, 'ChIJn2vJDLAYoFMRP7nAVvU27-w', '2026-08-06T06:40:39.880Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:39.880Z')
