<p>From selection to planting, we help you add lasting structure and beauty with trees and hedges that are suited to your property.</p>', 'Wilson Landscaping — landscaping in Ottawa | Fieseros', 'Book Wilson Landscaping for landscaping services in Ottawa. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (55 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:47.408Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 6, 'ChIJXZjEWi4QzkwRFwIYiX3Yzh4', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.289Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.289Z')
