<p>Founded in 2020 by Isaac Bennett , Bennett Lawn & Landscape brings Ottawa homeowners full-service outdoor living, designed and built by one dedicated crew. The company specializes in interlock patios, driveways, and walkways, retaining walls, and complete backyard installs, from sod and garden beds to the final cleanup. Every project is personally managed by Isaac from the first site visit to the last, so you get one quote, one team, and a finished space built to handle Ottawa’s freeze-thaw seasons for years to come. Serving Ottawa and surrounding communities including Barrhaven, Kanata, Manotick, Nepean, Richmond, and Carleton Place. Book your consultation today ; your dream yard awaits.</p>
<p>Sod, planting beds, grading, and full backyard installs, coordinated by Isaac from the first site visit to final cleanup. One crew, one quote, no juggling contractors.</p>
<p>Retaining walls, steps, and outdoor structures built to last. Every project starts with proper excavation and drainage, because what’s underneath determines how long the surface holds up.</p>', 'Bennett Lawn and Landscape — landscaping in Ottawa | Fieseros', 'Book Bennett Lawn and Landscape for landscaping services in Ottawa. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (25 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:49.439Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 6, 'ChIJWz8XxOifWQERyKpfR4WdNjc', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.290Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.290Z')
