<p>Bring your yard to life with thoughtfully selected plants and a variety of ground cover options. Intentional garden design adds natural beauty while incorporating smart solutions for rainwater runoff and erosion control. From mulch and rock garden beds to the perfect lawn, softscaping creates the foundation for your picture-perfect outdoor living space.</p>
<p>NeighborScape offers complete design and build landscaping services , managing every stage from concept…</p>', 'NeighborScape — landscaping in Ottawa | Fieseros', 'Book NeighborScape for landscaping services in Ottawa. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (93 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:49.571Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 11, 'ChIJr8QZwgLhzUwRf2OHeGy2hXU', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.290Z', '2026-08-06T06:40:53.290Z')
