  VALUES ('cmsh5d6zsk48bl3raoihw', 'Hardscape Ottawa', 'hardscape-ottawa-78eed2', 'landscaping', '+1 613-614-2273', NULL, 'http://www.hardscapeottawa.com/', '963 Connaught Ave, Ottawa, ON K2B 5M7', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Ottawa', 'ON', 'K2B 5M7', 45.358574, -75.78206519999999, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.6, 33, 'Hardscape Ottawa — landscaping in Ottawa', '<p>As a top interlock landscape contractor in Ottawa we use only the best products and innovative engineered gravel base construction in our landscapes to offer an industry-leading 5 year warranty! Learn more</p>
<p>Ottawa interlock landscapes endure some of the harshest conditions in the world. Your interlock stone patio and driveway will experience constant freeze/thaw cycles, deicing salt, and battle with poor (clay) subgrade conditions.</p>
<p>Through our use of innovative construction materials and techniques we build landscapes that will endure the elements and last a lifetime.</p>
<p>We supply and install a wide variety of fiberglass pools and pool automation equipment to meet the needs of your yard and your family.</p>
<p>Permeable driveways use the latest in landscape engineering and technology to absorb stormwater and return it to the water table.</p>
<p>Interlock paver patios built to meet or exceed ICPI specifications. Beautifully crafted with custom inlays and designs.</p>', 'Hardscape Ottawa — landscaping in Ottawa | Fieseros', 'Book Hardscape Ottawa for landscaping services in Ottawa. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.6★ (33 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:40:54.184Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJa53q-ioBzkwR9Xj2KVmNQZw', '2026-08-06T06:41:03.483Z', '2026-08-06T06:41:03.483Z')
