<p>Founded in 2013 by Scott Laporte, Unique Landscape Services grew out of a simple belief: life is better outdoors. Since day one, our mission has been to improve the homes and lives of clients through unique, quality-crafted landscapes.</p>
<p>Tell us about your vision, and we’ll be in touch within two business days to schedule your consultation.</p>
