  VALUES ('cmsh5fdepi0bgxcjiw6cm', 'Merci Landscaping Ltd.', 'merci-landscaping-ltd-53b1d1', 'landscaping', '+1 778-323-9931', 'info@mercilandscaping.ca', 'http://www.mercilandscaping.ca/', '38 Lynn Dr, Dartmouth, NS B2Y 3V9', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Dartmouth', 'NS', 'B2Y 3V9', 44.6644058, -63.5401868, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 13, 'Merci Landscaping Ltd. — landscaping in Dartmouth', '<p>Merci Landscaping is all about making outdoor areas vibrant and cozy. What we do ranges from a peaceful garden nook to a spacious, friendly patio; we design spaces that are part of your house and allow you to have the memorable moments that remain with you!</p>
<p>We’re a small team of dedicated landscaping artisans who believe that every yard has potential.Based in Halifax, Nova Scotia, we’re rooted in this region’s aesthetic – the clean lines, natural materials, airy transitions – and we bring that sensibility to each project. Whether you want a full makeover or just a fresh update for the season, we plan carefully, work with skill, and focus on creating something that holds up beautifully over time.</p>
<p>Your backyard should reflect you – the way you live, the way you unwind, the way you host. A luxury outdoor space doesn’t come from overdesigning – it comes from understanding how you want to live in it. Maybe it’s a soft-lit patio where evenings feel slower, or a garden path that winds just enough to feel inviting. We study your space, the natural rhythm around it, and the atmosphere you want. The final design ends up feeling effortless, as if it always belonged there.…</p>', 'Merci Landscaping Ltd. — landscaping in Dartmouth | Fieseros', 'Book Merci Landscaping Ltd. for landscaping services in Dartmouth. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (13 reviews).', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:42:35.809Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 6, 'ChIJt-JasyojWksRTlkK8GKHSjc', '2026-08-06T06:42:43.594Z', '2026-08-06T06:42:43.594Z')
