<p>With 15 years of experience, Mike is a skilled hardscaper with a sharp eye for detail and a dedication to quality workmanship. He takes pride in creating durable, functional outdoor spaces that are as beautiful as…</p>', 'Crews Control Property Maintenance — landscaping in Dartmouth | Fieser', 'Book Crews Control Property Maintenance for landscaping services in Dartmouth. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (111 revi', '["landscaping"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:42:36.666Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 13, 'ChIJxX2AFvTBKCUR1YXuyQ7RiH0', '2026-08-06T06:42:43.594Z', '2026-08-06T06:42:43.594Z')
