<p>We repair warm-air AC issues, water leaks, loud compressors, dirty coils, and thermostat drift before a humid Toronto week becomes unbearable.</p>
<p>Furnace issues are safety issues. We inspect heat exchangers, blower motors, ignition systems, and recommend high-efficiency upgrades only when they truly make sense.</p>
<p>Our pricing philosophy is simple: tell the truth, explain the options, and respect the budget. The fix might be a part swap, not a full replacement.</p>', 'Sameday Heating & Cooling — hvac in Toronto | Fieseros', 'Book Sameday Heating & Cooling for hvac services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (24 reviews).', '["hvac"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:43:14.200Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 15, 'ChIJL8-XKP3L1IkR1rozSlHWVw8', '2026-08-06T06:43:16.711Z', '2026-08-06T06:43:16.711Z')
