<p>Our specialty is commercial refrigeration for restaurants, bakeries and bars. We also handle full HVAC and gas work.</p>
<p>Service, repair and maintenance, including warranty work for all major ice machine brands.</p>
<p>From rooftop unit swaps in downtown Toronto to full cold-storage builds. This is the work, not stock photos.</p>
<p>Simon Climate Solutions offers flexible maintenance plans tailored to your equipment and usage, available on a quarterly, every four months, semi-annual, or annual basis. Every customer''s needs are different, and we will only recommend what makes sense for your system, never more.</p>
<p>Regular maintenance is one of the most cost-effective investments you can make in your equipment. Keeping condenser and evaporator coils clean reduces runtime, prevents compressor overheating, improves efficiency, and significantly extends the life of the unit. Routine visits also allow us to catch small issues before they turn into costly breakdowns.</p>', 'Simon Climate Solutions — hvac in Toronto | Fieseros', 'Book Simon Climate Solutions for hvac services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (15 reviews).', '["hvac","construction"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:43:16.709Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 12, 'ChIJr3YBi9E1K4gR_ilxNKLkBVQ', '2026-08-06T06:43:16.711Z', '2026-08-06T06:43:16.711Z')
