<p>Nettoyage conduits ventilation et installation pour…</p>', 'Groupe Rousso — hvac in Longueuil | Fieseros', 'Book Groupe Rousso for hvac services in Longueuil. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.7★ (234 reviews).', '["hvac","construction"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:43:38.714Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 3, 'ChIJ0SbDP7qryUwRh3GzgurjeE0', '2026-08-06T06:43:47.794Z', '2026-08-06T06:43:47.794Z')
