  VALUES ('cmsh5i26minq5qkono04s', 'Alberta Mountain Air Heating & Air Conditioning', 'alberta-mountain-air-heating-air-conditi-8e3437', 'hvac', '+1 403-236-4366', NULL, 'https://albertamountainair.com/', '11929 40 St SE #214, Calgary, AB T2Z 4M8', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Calgary', 'AB', 'T2Z 4M8', 50.94388, -113.976851, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.8, 1101, 'Alberta Mountain Air Heating & Air Conditioning — hvac in Calgary', '<p>When your furnace stops working in January or your AC struggles during a July heat wave, you need clear answers quickly.</p>
<p>Do you take a chance and call a one-man HVAC tradesman or pick up the phone to a team of trusted HVAC professionals?</p>
<p>Whether you''re in the deep south of Calgary, out in Cochrane, or anywhere in between, our team can help you plan the right next step for heating, cooling, hot water, duct cleaning, or indoor air quality service.</p>
