  VALUES ('cmsh5iloa7mxx6ps1462b', 'Enercare McKinley', 'enercare-mckinley-6d501a', 'hvac', '+1 780-474-1481', NULL, 'http://mckinleyheating.com/?utm_source=google-business-profile&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=business-listing&utm_content=edmonton', '11122 156 St, Edmonton, AB T5M 1Y1', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Edmonton', 'AB', 'T5M 1Y1', 53.560143499999995, -113.59093329999999, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.9, 2564, 'Enercare McKinley — hvac in Edmonton', '<p>I had Alex Y in to do an A/C maintenance service, and he was great! Right on time with a courtesy call prior to arriving. He also informed about McKinley''s very reasonable furnace service plan, which ends up saving money over just doing the regular furn...</p>
<p>Thanks to Alex Y for his professional yearly service. He not only answered my questions about the furnace/humidifier but also showed and explained everything I asked for. I appreciated his heads up that he was a little behind, then arrived as advised.</p>
<p>Stephen C. and Kyle did a great job installing my replacement furnace, in particular, fishing a new 4wire cable through a very tight spot to install the new advanced panel thermostat.</p>
<p>Alex Y was very professional, timely, and courteous. He explained everything clearly and showed me the results of his work. We are very pleased with everything he’s done.</p>
<p>Enercare McKinley started in 1968 with the goal of delivering some of the best heating, cooling and plumbing practices in the industry. From that day forward, we’ve believed in the quality of our work so much, we’ve backed it with a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee* for a year.</p>', 'Enercare McKinley — hvac in Edmonton | Fieseros', 'Book Enercare McKinley for hvac services in Edmonton. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (2564 reviews).', '["hvac","construction","plumbing"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:45:06.490Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJdXxS_0AhoFMRmmJWbJmU3uk', '2026-08-06T06:45:23.204Z', '2026-08-06T06:45:23.204Z')
