<p>It is not often you see home service professionals smiling, but we love what we do and we love helping you! Call us today to see for yourselves.</p>
<p>When the scorching Winnipeg summer arrives, a broken air conditioner can spell disaster. Whether you need a new system, a repair or a seasonal tune-up, Lynn’s has you covered. Our licensed technicians service all makes and models throughout Winnipeg and surrounding areas.</p>
<p>Need a new AC system? We help you choose the right unit for your home and install it for you.</p>
<p>If your AC is blowing warm air, making strange noises or not turning on at all, you should be worried. We diagnose and repair all makes and models with same-day…</p>', 'Lynn''s Plumbing Heating & Cooling — hvac in Winnipeg | Fieseros', 'Book Lynn''s Plumbing Heating & Cooling for hvac services in Winnipeg. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (967 reviews).', '["hvac","construction","plumbing"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:47:08.572Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJv-Bdl0tw6lIRuX_o2-AkJTE', '2026-08-06T06:47:14.047Z', '2026-08-06T06:47:14.047Z')
