<p>It is not often you see HVAC professionals smiling, but we love what we do and we love helping you! Call us today to see for yourselves.</p>
<p>South Winnipeg summers may be short, but the heat hits hard. A broken-down air conditioner is the last thing you want to deal with when temperatures climb. Lynn’s provides complete air conditioning services, from central systems and packaged units to repairs and annual maintenance, for homeowners throughout the area.</p>', 'Lynn''s Plumbing Heating & Cooling Southside — hvac in Winnipeg | Fiese', 'Book Lynn''s Plumbing Heating & Cooling Southside for hvac services in Winnipeg. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (88 revi', '["hvac","construction","plumbing"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:47:08.590Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 14, 'ChIJN_G-RAh16lIRv4-DWYN9sI8', '2026-08-06T06:47:14.049Z', '2026-08-06T06:47:14.049Z')
