<p>Customers also call us when they want to prevent breakdowns before they happen. Regular tune-ups, indoor air quality upgrades, and proactive duct cleaning can help equipment last longer, reduce strain on the system, and keep your home healthier and more efficient throughout the year.</p>
<p>This company did all the ductwork in our home when we built it 18 years go. They also installed our furnace and air conditioner. We hired them because the general contractor…</p>', 'East Side Ventilation Ltd - Furnace and HVAC in Winnipeg — hvac in Win', 'Book East Side Ventilation Ltd - Furnace and HVAC in Winnipeg for hvac services in Winnipeg. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated ', '["hvac","construction"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:47:15.154Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 1, 'ChIJ671zMv556lIRCaKyDbr2jzY', '2026-08-06T06:47:20.212Z', '2026-08-06T06:47:20.212Z')
