  VALUES ('cmsh5x198ljbgbn9dy48a', 'Greg''s Plumbing and Heating Inc.', 'gregs-plumbing-and-heating-inc-51cc5f', 'hvac', '+1 905-928-6831', NULL, 'https://gregsplumbing.ca/', '69 Bigwin Rd #1, Hamilton, ON L8W 3R3', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Hamilton', 'ON', 'L8W 3R3', 43.19356, -79.82079, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 4.7, 268, 'Greg''s Plumbing and Heating Inc. — hvac in Hamilton', '<p>Greg’s Plumbing & Heating is a licensed plumbing and HVAC company in Hamilton, Ontario. Same-day service for homes and businesses across Hamilton, Stoney Creek, Ancaster, Dundas, Binbrook, Caledonia and Grimsby. Clear options before work starts. Local since 2018.</p>
<p>Greg’s Plumbing & Heating Inc. is a licensed plumbing and HVAC company based in Hamilton, Ontario at 69 Bigwin Rd Unit 1. Since 2018, we have helped homeowners, businesses, and property managers across Hamilton, Stoney Creek, Ancaster, Dundas, Binbrook, Caledonia, and Grimsby with plumbing, drains, water heaters, gas lines, furnace, boiler, AC, and 24/7 emergency plumbing service. Every job starts with clear options before work begins.</p>
<p>Sinks, tubs, showers or main lines cleared same-day. Snaking or hydro-jetting as needed.</p>
