  VALUES ('cmsh5xd8kg7vh2dfbsrjs', 'Breath Assured Heat Pump and Duct Cleaning', 'breath-assured-heat-pump-and-duct-cleani-5818f4', 'hvac', '+1 902-417-2219', 'service@breathassured.ca', 'https://breathassured.ca/', '50 Eileen Stubbs Ave #130, Dartmouth, NS B3B 0M7', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Dartmouth', 'NS', 'B3B 0M7', 44.6988863, -63.5793986, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 661, 'Breath Assured Heat Pump and Duct Cleaning — hvac in Dartmouth', '<p>Take advantage of all the convenience and cost savings of heating your home with a heat pump. Call for pricing today .</p>
<p>HEAT PUMPS CAN BE BREEDING GROUNDS FOR BLACK MOLD. Yvonne Colbert CBC Consumer Watchdog.</p>
<p>Breath Assured is your top choice cleaning company for heat pumps, ventilation units, dryer vents, and air conditioning units in Halifax, Dartmouth, and the HRM. A family owned and operated company, Breath Assured is providing complete Heating and cooling solutions including HVAC installation , maintenance & repairing while specializing in improving your home’s indoor air quality, safeguarding your family from invasive mold, with a fresh and clean air environment.</p>
<p>Breath Assured thoroughly cleans your evaporator coil! This includes cleaning and sanitizing the mini-split, coil, and barrel fan.</p>
<p>Units with dirty evaporator coils labour too hard to effectively conditon the air. The surface area, when covered with grime, is compromised, making heat and cold air transfer inefficient, and your system sluggish.</p>
