<p>Discover Efficiency provides professional heat pump installation, repair, servicing, and deep cleaning for all major brands and models across the Halifax Regional Municipality (HRM) and East Hants. We also install and service air conditioners and air exchangers.</p>', 'Discover Efficiency HVAC — hvac in Dartmouth | Fieseros', 'Book Discover Efficiency HVAC for hvac services in Dartmouth. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (38 reviews).', '["hvac","construction"]', '{"emailSource":"none","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:56:34.739Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 7, 'ChIJsTb1L3o0XIsRY1ioqPz2Md8', '2026-08-06T06:56:41.420Z', '2026-08-06T06:56:41.420Z')
