<p>Electrical emergencies don’t wait for business hours — and neither do we. Whether it’s 2 AM on a Sunday or the middle of a holiday, Ontime Electric’s licensed Toronto electricians are ready to respond quickly to urgent electrical problems. We understand how stressful and potentially dangerous a sudden electrical…</p>', 'Ontime Electrician — electrical in Toronto | Fieseros', 'Book Ontime Electrician for electrical services in Toronto. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (280 reviews).', '["electrical"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:57:01.695Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 2, 'ChIJ6Rh7gJYzK4gR_Ss7EUlKcHM', '2026-08-06T06:57:12.030Z', '2026-08-06T06:57:12.030Z')
