<p>Customized consulting for strata electrification projects — EV charging rollouts, heat pump conversions, large retrofits. We manage the project on your strata''s behalf; licensed contractors carry out the installation.</p>
<p>Your strata pays for these reports, and your council has to budget from them, vote on them, and explain them to owners. Every report we prepare carries full technical rigour underneath — and plain language your council can act on, on top. Engage us for both an EPR and an EV Ready Plan and your report also comes with a Living Report at no extra charge: an interactive web version any owner can open in a browser, alongside the…</p>', 'CF Electrical Services — electrical in Vancouver | Fieseros', 'Book CF Electrical Services for electrical services in Vancouver. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.9★ (74 reviews).', '["electrical"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:57:58.757Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 10, 'ChIJ6yW1U7mA8AsRmSGb-drMMIw', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.914Z', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.914Z')
  ON CONFLICT ("googlePlaceId") DO NOTHING;

