  VALUES ('cmsh5z5pzs1tvmhm9r7wu', 'Akai Electric Ltd', 'akai-electric-ltd-ce782e', 'electrical', '+1 604-760-2524', 'info@akaielectric.ca', 'https://www.akaielectric.ca/', '3845 Ortona Crescent, Vancouver, BC V6R 1X6', 'CA', 'CAD', 'Vancouver', 'BC', 'V6R 1X6', 49.2671431, -123.1902178, 25, 'business', true, true, 'free', false, 5, 40, 'Akai Electric Ltd — electrical in Vancouver', '<p>At Akai Electric, everything starts with the client. Our approach is built around making your experience seamless, stress-free, and grounded in trust. From first contact to final sign-off, expect professionalism, safety, and a strong commitment to doing things right—every time.</p>
