<p>We hired Akai to do some wiring in our basement, and they were excellent. The electricians were really professional and made sure everything was done safely and on time. I''m really happy with how it turned out.</p>
<p>We serve all of Metro Vancouver, including but not limited to the following areas:</p>
<p>Vancouver — We serve all of Vancouver from Kitsilano to East Van, including Downtown, West End, Mount Pleasant, Fairview, Kerrisdale, Dunbar, Shaughnessy, Marpole, and UBC/Point Grey.</p>', 'Akai Electric Ltd — electrical in Vancouver | Fieseros', 'Book Akai Electric Ltd for electrical services in Vancouver. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 5.0★ (40 reviews).', '["electrical"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:57:58.967Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 10, 'ChIJG58aKpGbzwERwsoFSceAdoQ', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.915Z', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.915Z')
