<p>Our promise is simple: we show up, we figure it out, and we fix it. Usually in a single visit. Every job is done to code, fully insured, no shortcuts.</p>
<p>We track down the root cause instead of guessing and replacing parts. Saving you money and repeat visits.</p>
<p>BC Electrical Contractor LEL0207708. Red Seal Journeymen & Master Electricians. We pull permits and pass inspection.</p>
<p>Real electrical emergencies don''t wait for business hours. Neither do we. Typically on-site within about two hours.</p>
<p>Trusted on real projects. Including the EasyPark lighting installation at the Downtown Vancouver Public Library.</p>', 'EZ Electric — electrical in Vancouver | Fieseros', 'Book EZ Electric for electrical services in Vancouver. Professional, reliable, and trusted by local customers. Rated 4.8★ (42 reviews).', '["electrical"]', '{"emailSource":"website_scrape","emailVerified":false,"descriptionSource":"website_scrape","seededAt":"2026-08-06T06:58:00.424Z","seedSource":"google-places"}', 9, 'ChIJWw3snidxhlQR-m809BDhMC0', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.915Z', '2026-08-06T06:58:07.915Z')
